WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.292 --> 00:00:01.919
[Richard Hobbes]
Let me give you a piece of advice.

00:00:02.002 --> 00:00:04.963
If you're gonna steal… steal a lot.

00:00:08.300 --> 00:00:10.552
-Sir, the police are here.
-The police?

00:00:10.636 --> 00:00:11.720
-Sir.
-Get your hands off of me!

00:00:11.803 --> 00:00:13.847
Detective! Can we talk about this?

00:00:14.598 --> 00:00:16.725
[Richard Hobbes]
I'm gonna pay you for your time.

00:00:17.100 --> 00:00:18.894
Stop. He's not a cop.

00:00:18.977 --> 00:00:20.687
This is what my son does.

00:00:20.771 --> 00:00:22.231
He plays these games.

00:00:22.314 --> 00:00:25.317
[Richard Hobbes]
All that work for 1,000 dollars.

00:00:26.985 --> 00:00:30.239
If you're gonna steal… steal a lot.

00:00:35.410 --> 00:00:36.745
-What are you doing here?
-Just wanted to say, "Hi."

00:00:36.828 --> 00:00:38.622
-Not a good time.
-All right, cool. See you around, Dad.

00:00:39.998 --> 00:00:42.918
I always assumed
my son would inherit all this.

00:00:43.126 --> 00:00:45.796
He doesn't have the fortitude.
He's weak.

00:00:45.879 --> 00:00:49.132
♪ Whoever said money
Can't solve your problems ♪

00:00:49.216 --> 00:00:52.135
♪ Must not have had
Enough money to solve 'em ♪

00:00:52.219 --> 00:00:53.387
You like him a little bit.

00:00:54.888 --> 00:00:57.099
[Madeline] Of course, I like him.
He's a billionaire.

00:00:57.933 --> 00:01:01.186
♪ Been through some bad
And I should be a savage ♪

00:01:01.311 --> 00:01:04.606
♪ Who woulda thought
It'd turn me to a savage ♪

00:01:06.149 --> 00:01:07.442
[Max] We're celebrating.

00:01:07.526 --> 00:01:09.319
What exactly are we celebrating?

00:01:09.403 --> 00:01:10.904
Billions of dollars.

00:01:12.781 --> 00:01:15.409
[Max] Roll up your sleeves.
Trust me.

00:01:16.869 --> 00:01:18.912
You can't cheat an honest man.

00:01:20.664 --> 00:01:22.708
That's why we never feel sorry
for the mark.

00:01:22.791 --> 00:01:24.084
[Sandra] I really like you.

00:01:24.168 --> 00:01:25.711
I really like you, too.

00:01:26.712 --> 00:01:27.546
You lied to me.

00:01:27.629 --> 00:01:29.006
[Madeline] We're all human.

00:01:29.423 --> 00:01:31.133
Just doing the best we can.

00:01:31.216 --> 00:01:33.427
[Richard Hobbes]
You cause your mother anguish.

00:01:33.510 --> 00:01:34.595
And I will not have it.

00:01:34.887 --> 00:01:36.388
She wants me gone.

00:01:38.724 --> 00:01:40.100
How do you think this ends?

00:01:40.601 --> 00:01:41.810
Not well.

00:01:49.193 --> 00:01:50.277
[Madeline] What did you tell him?

00:01:51.028 --> 00:01:53.780
I'm gonna take a billion
dollars and aim it in your direction.

00:01:54.489 --> 00:01:56.533
Sandra! Sandra!

00:01:57.784 --> 00:01:58.785
[Sandra] Is this real?

00:01:59.453 --> 00:02:00.454
[Tom] This is real.

00:02:02.039 --> 00:02:03.332
How can I be sure?

